		"description": "<p>With a broad slash of your weapon, you conjure forth flames that flicker and rise, threateningly. After dealing damage with a melee weapon, select three spaces within your reach. These three spaces become a wall of flame 5ft high which lasts until the end of your next turn. Creatures that enter the space or end their turn within it take fire damage as though you’d struck them with your weapon.</p>",
